	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "4",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1000.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Good leather and bags.\" Another day of those eyes that think they know better than mine. Why am I talking to my annoying neighbor?",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "0",
		"position_offset:x": "100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1460.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Good leather and bags.\" A superior expression looks down at you.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "1",
		"conversation_id": "5",
		"expressions": "0",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-40.0",
		"text": "(idk..)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "3",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "540.0",
		"recipients": "Freya",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Good leather and bags.\" The aging merchant looks up at you, light with joy and comfort.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "7",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "540.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1120.0",
		"speaker": "Geno",
		"text": "\"Hello Marrow.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "12",
		"position_offset:x": "-780.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2100.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Reka and Benjamin can purchase supplies.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "15",
		"position_offset:x": "-1440.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-360.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "Marrow is a content-seeming and enigmatic shopkeep with a small inventory and a long legacy in the Breach. She is nearly blind. \n\nGeno hates her because of how successful she manages to kep her shop while not seeming to catalogue anything.\n\nMarrow stands as a contrast to Arias because Geno does not trust her, but she is a good person, while Arias is the opposite in both respects.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "11",
		"position_offset:x": "-780.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2680.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Geno can have a tense exchange about how to best run a shop.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "3",
		"conversation_id": "16",
		"position_offset:x": "-360.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2680.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Geno has lots of thoughts towards Marrow, but ultimately doesn't say much, and any other character can guide things back to their path.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "4",
		"conversation_id": "17",
		"position_offset:x": "-380.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2100.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Somebody may or may not purchase:\n - A deep leather pouch\n - A waterskin (belt equipment)\n - A vest and shirt (torso equipment, either Reka or Benjamin)\n\nGeno can make a crack about the selection. Freya can look around the shop.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "18",
		"position_offset:x": "220.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1380.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Nothing is purchased",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "20",
		"position_offset:x": "200.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1880.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Marrow explains that there are creatures in the desert with \"knife hands\" and they \"aim for the heart,\" so the vest acts as a second skin.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "21",
		"position_offset:x": "200.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2400.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Marrow explains how this particular waterskin was carried here by her sister, on the North-South Pilgrimage, but it's ok to sell because a waterskin was meant to be used, and she's too old for expeditions.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "3",
		"conversation_id": "10",
		"position_offset:x": "-1240.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1960.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Entering the shop",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "13",
		"position_offset:x": "-740.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1060.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Freya can ask for either a story about the desert or for info on a criminal she's been tracking.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "23",
		"position_offset:x": "-320.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1240.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Marrow talks about when she went on expeditions when she was younger, a near miss encounter with bandits, and her triumphant return. She describes it as a \"silent victory.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "24",
		"position_offset:x": "-320.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-740.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Marrow is getting protection from the Bani-Manci from the Rouge Bandits. But one of the implicit conditions is silence. Freya is able to tell this is what's happening just from her stance. Nothing needs to be said.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "4",
		"conversation_id": "6",
		"position_offset:x": "1060.0",
		"position_offset:y": "500.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"The Morehai is both hot and cold. If you're planning something, bring plenty of water and all the right fabrics.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "27",
		"position_offset:x": "2040.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3520.0",
		"speaker": "Evil",
		"text": "Realistically, why am I talking to her? Might as well pry a little.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "3",
		"conversation_id": "28",
		"position_offset:x": "2480.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3520.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Fine. Just fine. And what's that to you, young man? Slow day?\" The old woman changes her stance. Suddenly, two businessmen doing business.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "33",
		"position_offset:x": "3420.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-4440.0",
		"speaker": "Geno",
		"text": "\"Maybe you don't understand.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "34",
		"flags": "5",
		"position_offset:x": "2960.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3420.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"text": "(Do the right thing.)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "36",
		"position_offset:x": "3080.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3960.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Dice check:\n - Auto node\n - Link to a node with a \"check\" ask",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "32",
		"flags": "5",
		"position_offset:x": "3020.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-4480.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"text": "(Keep arguing)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "30",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "2580.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3320.0",
		"recipients": "Freya",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "The leatherworking shop is warm, and it's been here for a long time. The small shopkeep has seen things, though on closer inspection her eyes are poor.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "25",
		"position_offset:x": "1740.0",
		"position_offset:y": "760.0",
		"text": "\"What do you have?\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "38",
		"position_offset:x": "3440.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3380.0",
		"speaker": "Evil",
		"text": "The \"right\" thing? In 10 Thousand years, our determination will have decided our memory. Don't let this pitiful creature stand in our way. This business is only the beginning.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "39",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "3920.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3400.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"text": "Wait, what am I about to do exactly?",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "42",
		"position_offset:x": "5280.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3300.0",
		"speaker": "Evil",
		"text": "Correct. ",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "40",
		"position_offset:x": "4400.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3400.0",
		"speaker": "Rhetoric",
		"text": "Use words. Create a situation where my existence is so above hers that there's nothing left for her to do.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "41",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "4860.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3420.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"text": "That feels wrong.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "43",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "4860.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2940.0",
		"recipients": "Geno",
		"text": "Ok. Here we go!",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "45",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "5680.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3140.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "47",
		"position_offset:x": "3900.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3920.0",
		"speaker": "Good",
		"text": "This is pointless, but I'm not in too deep yet.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "check Good 10",
		"conversation_id": "35",
		"position_offset:x": "3440.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3940.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "49",
		"expressions": "%speaker != \"Geno\"",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "2980.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2840.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "50",
		"position_offset:x": "2480.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2820.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "In 49, I want the ability for Reka, Benjamin, or Freya to interrupt, but don't have a concise way to represent this in the current engine limits.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "8",
		"position_offset:x": "560.0",
		"position_offset:y": "740.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "7 is an Auto domination of 6, but this mechanic is not implemented yet.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "48",
		"position_offset:x": "4420.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3940.0",
		"speaker": "Geno",
		"text": "\"Actually, I came to buy something.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "51",
		"position_offset:x": "3880.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-4440.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Don't understand? Don't understand what. Your spreadsheet? Those are for department stores, not popup shops.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "52",
		"position_offset:x": "4380.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-4440.0",
		"speaker": "Geno",
		"text": "\"You don't understand the long game.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "53",
		"position_offset:x": "4780.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-4440.0",
		"speaker": "Rhetoric",
		"text": "Immediate regret. She's like 500 times older than me.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "54",
		"position_offset:x": "2540.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3900.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "A leatherworker's shop staffed by an old woman.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "59",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "3100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1640.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "22",
		"position_offset:x": "180.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2920.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "While selling, if Reka is present and wearing the formula fabric, she complains that true leatherworking is a dying art.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "63",
		"position_offset:x": "4580.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1560.0",
		"speaker": "Planets",
		"text": "In Wenth, south of Ironand, families farming cattle for dozens of generations work their leather into whatever they can manage before its time to go back out on the field. It's pretty, but sad, and serves no purpose.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "65",
		"expressions": "bought_something = 0",
		"position_offset:x": "5140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1560.0",
		"text": "\"I don't know if I can use this.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "64",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "5140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1920.0",
		"text": "\"I'll take it.\" (10 gold)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "buy %speaker Marrow \"Leather Bag\" 10",
		"conversation_id": "68",
		"expressions": "bought_something = 1",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "5540.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1920.0",
		"text": "\"I'll take it.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "62",
		"position_offset:x": "4580.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2120.0",
		"speaker": "Body",
		"text": "A deep brown hue and heavy stitches line a deep pocket worn around the belt. A suitable container for the hearts of your enemies.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "61",
		"position_offset:x": "4140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1340.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"I found this bag at a pawn shop many miles south of here. It's clearly desert gear, but nobody has picked it up yet. If you don't think it's ominous, I'll give you a good price.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "67",
		"expressions": "bought_something",
		"position_offset:x": "7220.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-280.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Thank you! Your funds won't go to waste.\" She motions to a crooked wheel on the drawer.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "83",
		"position_offset:x": "4720.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-80.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"For food.\" For the first time, she does not look forward. \"It's ok. It's a strong skin. My sister is dead and buried a long time now, and my traveling days are well over.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "85",
		"position_offset:x": "4280.0",
		"position_offset:y": "280.0",
		"text": "\"Sounds important.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "26",
		"position_offset:x": "1620.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-3520.0",
		"speaker": "Geno",
		"text": "\"How's business?\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "69",
		"position_offset:x": "7220.0",
		"position_offset:y": "500.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Oh well. I'll keep it then.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "3",
		"conversation_id": "75",
		"position_offset:x": "3520.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-420.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Ah. This particular artifact was carried by my sister on the north-south pilgrimmage over 30 years ago.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "87",
		"position_offset:x": "5200.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-100.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Anyway, since you've been such good conversation, I'll let go of it for 15 gold.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "71",
		"position_offset:x": "4700.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-500.0",
		"speaker": "Bones",
		"text": "Gray skin feels primed to become one with you.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "82",
		"position_offset:x": "4280.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-80.0",
		"text": "\"Why are you selling it?\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "88",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "4240.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-440.0",
		"speaker": "Reka",
		"text": "(Touch the waterskin)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "89",
		"position_offset:x": "5200.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-520.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"I'd be willing to let go for 25 gold.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "91",
		"expressions": "bought_something = 0",
		"position_offset:x": "5640.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-300.0",
		"text": "\"I think I'll keep looking.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "92",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "5640.0",
		"position_offset:y": "300.0",
		"text": "\"Perfect, thank you.\" (15 gold)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "90",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "5640.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-660.0",
		"text": "\"Deal\" (25 gold)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "buy %speaker Marrow \"Waterskin\" 15",
		"conversation_id": "95",
		"expressions": "bought_something = 1",
		"position_offset:x": "6080.0",
		"position_offset:y": "300.0",
		"text": "\"Perfect, thank you.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "buy %speaker Marrow \"Waterskin\" 25",
		"conversation_id": "94",
		"expressions": "bought_something = 1",
		"position_offset:x": "6060.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-800.0",
		"text": "\"Deal\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "76",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "6800.0",
		"position_offset:y": "0.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "4",
		"conversation_id": "37",
		"position_offset:x": "2200.0",
		"position_offset:y": "860.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Oh. Not much today.\" She slowly pulls an ancient drawer off its rails and places it on the counter.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"additional_data": "\"hover_item\": \"Waterskin\"",
		"callbacks": "has_item Marrow \"Waterskin\"",
		"choices": "1",
		"conversation_id": "56",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "2860.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-340.0",
		"text": "(Inspect the waterskin)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "60",
		"expressions": "$(get_equipment Reka Torso) == \"Polymer Blend Black (Top)\"\n$(is_present Reka)",
		"position_offset:x": "4140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-2080.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Leatherworking is a dying art. I heard that deep in the capital factories they've developed strong fibers that are much lighter. But there's still a beauty to an old bag, don't you think?\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"additional_data": "\"hover_item\": \"Leather Pouch\"",
		"callbacks": "has_item Marrow \"Leather Pouch\"",
		"conversation_id": "55",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "2640.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-1640.0",
		"text": "(Inspect the leather pouch)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "96",
		"flags": "6",
		"position_offset:x": "5100.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2560.0",
		"text": "(Leave it alone.)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "97",
		"position_offset:x": "1580.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3880.0",
		"text": "\"I think I'll come back later.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "kick %speaker",
		"conversation_id": "98",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "1960.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3920.0",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "31",
		"position_offset:x": "2940.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3300.0",
		"speaker": "Sight",
		"text": "Freya was surprised when she felt relief at the thought of being blind, at the thought of not being troubled by the exact color and shape of things. ",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "29",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "2040.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3240.0",
		"text": "(Look around the shop)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "86",
		"position_offset:x": "4720.0",
		"position_offset:y": "440.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"Anything can become important. Even a simple waterskin.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "73",
		"position_offset:x": "3680.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2420.0",
		"speaker": "Sight",
		"text": "The vest came with a black shirt. Freya felt a presence from both. Sure enough, as she turned it over, there was an embroidery on the back of the vest. Small red letters: \"Sandman\", a common Duster nickname. ",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "100",
		"position_offset:x": "3680.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3020.0",
		"speaker": "Speed",
		"text": "A Duster vest? Where did she get that? Does she have an errant grandson?",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "101",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "4180.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1580.0",
		"recipients": "Benjamin",
		"text": "What? Why?",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "103",
		"position_offset:x": "4660.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1960.0",
		"speaker": "Future",
		"text": "You're new to this world. Follow my lead and the fewest people will get hurt.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "102",
		"flags": "4",
		"position_offset:x": "4180.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2020.0",
		"recipients": "Benjamin",
		"text": "Don't tell me what to do.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "104",
		"position_offset:x": "4180.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3020.0",
		"speaker": "Rhetoric",
		"text": "The Dusters are a loose gang that you see around from time to time. Mostly juvenile. But it's not impossible they have some sway here. ",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "74",
		"position_offset:x": "5120.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2180.0",
		"text": "\"Who did you get this from?\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "105",
		"position_offset:x": "4620.0",
		"position_offset:y": "3020.0",
		"speaker": "Evil",
		"text": "Like hell I'll be held up for protection money by a teenager. Remember the protocol from Cresti: Diagnose, solve, and continue.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "58",
		"position_offset:x": "2280.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2400.0",
		"text": "\"Nevermind\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"additional_data": "\"hover_item\": \"Duster\"",
		"choices": "4",
		"conversation_id": "57",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "3140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "2100.0",
		"text": "(Inspect the vest)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "99",
		"position_offset:x": "3720.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1860.0",
		"speaker": "Future",
		"text": "Don't touch that. You're still vulnerable.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "72",
		"position_offset:x": "3660.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1120.0",
		"speaker": "Body",
		"text": "No. No good. This heavy vest would weight you down and cause sweating.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "110",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "8080.0",
		"position_offset:y": "240.0",
		"text": "(Go back to the shop)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"choices": "2",
		"conversation_id": "70",
		"position_offset:x": "7640.0",
		"position_offset:y": "-40.0",
		"speaker": "Marrow",
		"text": "\"And look out, in that desert. Whatever you do. Come back alive. So you can get something else next time.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "112",
		"position_offset:x": "-1848.15490722656",
		"position_offset:y": "-2104.529296875",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Nodes spoken \"Note\" are supposed to sit outside of the dialogue flow and describe the general structure of the conversation.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "113",
		"position_offset:x": "3140.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1540.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Note sure how I feel about this \"split-based\" flow in hub 57, since it's not easily extensible to new characters. Adding a new character either softlocks here or breaks the splitting behavior with no warning. ",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"callbacks": "kick %speaker",
		"conversation_id": "111",
		"flags": "1",
		"position_offset:x": "8080.0",
		"position_offset:y": "600.0",
		"text": "(Leave)",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "114",
		"position_offset:x": "8520.0",
		"position_offset:y": "600.0",
		"speaker": "Note",
		"text": "Not sure if %speaker is evaluated in callbacks like it's used in 111. Would be more convenient than something like `_x = $(kick %speaker)` though.",
		"type": "hub"
	},
	{
		"conversation_id": "108",
		"position_offset:x": "4240.0",
		"position_offset:y": "1120.0",
		"text": "\"Sorry, not for me.\"",
		"type": "hub"
	},
